Since April, people have told us their bookings land on the wrong day: a month flipped. By
4 October the desk had **412 reports**.

**Originally merged as one issue.** The parser reads dates month first, but booking-v3
also gives day-first tenants a conflicting form hint. These require separate tickets
and fixes. See the [signed review and replacement triage decision](/kb/decisions/0002-dedupe-by-cause).

<Callout>
The export records the old merge, not a repaired product. One queued parser fix does not
resolve the form hint problem, and the one-day anomalies still need investigation.
</Callout>

