<QueueTimeline ticket={4471} />

## Lessons

- Deduplicate export rows by report ID, then group by tenant context and cause.
- Preserve separate problems and uncertainty even when subject lines match.
- Rebuild the tables when new evidence arrives and verify each fix before closing tickets.
